{%- doc -%}
  Renders one of the theme's built-in default artwork photos (stored in assets as artwork-<key>-<width>.jpg).
  Used as the fallback when a merchant has not picked an image, so new sections never show empty boxes.

  @param {string} key - Artwork key, for example 'hero' or 'skincare'
  @param {string} [class] - Classes for the img element
  @param {string} [style] - Inline styles for the img element
  @param {string} [sizes] - The sizes attribute, defaults to 100vw
  @param {string} [loading] - 'lazy' (default) or 'eager'
  @param {string} [fetchpriority] - Fetch priority, defaults to auto

  @example
  {% render 'artwork', key: 'hero', sizes: '100vw', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

